  question: What does it mean to be holy?
  answers:
  - To sing a lot
  - To be set apart and morally perfect
  - Your clothes have lots of holes
  - You've been baptized
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: Holiness is to be distinct, set apart.  With God, it means that
    His glory sets Him apart from all other things.
